1
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:35,050
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:37,729
[Episode 14]

3
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,900
Make way, make way.

4
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:40,840
Slow down. Be careful.

5
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,640
It'll be fine.

6
00:01:44,759 --> 00:01:45,890
Be careful, please.

7
00:01:53,039 --> 00:01:53,509
Doctor,

8
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,280
you have to save my son.

9
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,150
He's still so young.

10
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:58,280
He can't die.

11
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,150
Doctor.

12
00:01:59,479 --> 00:02:00,890
Doctor, my brother is an athlete.

13
00:02:00,890 --> 00:02:02,250
You must save his leg,

14
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:02,760
doctor!

15
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,760
Please calm down.

16
00:02:04,790 --> 00:02:05,790
We'll do our best.

17
00:02:06,090 --> 00:02:06,610
You may

18
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,530
wait outside,

19
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,419
okay? Trust us.

20
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:15,960
Mom, Mom.

21
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,940
Help your mom sit down.

22
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:19,000
Mom.

23
00:02:19,190 --> 00:02:20,190
Come on, sit down.

24
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,360
Honey, stay strong.

25
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:35,520
Our son is a lucky guy.

26
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,360
He'll be fine.

27
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:40,430
Mom.

28
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:44,590
Why are you here?

29
00:02:45,150 --> 00:02:46,810
You didn't go to take the exam?

30
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,930
Feed her some water.

31
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,890
I was really afraid her brother
would be beaten to death!

32
00:03:02,890 --> 00:03:04,120
But I didn't expect that

33
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,580
Qi Shi would skip the exam.

34
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:07,400
What were you thinking?

35
00:03:07,530 --> 00:03:08,520
Why didn't you call the police when you

36
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,520
saw Qi Zhi getting beaten?

37
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,910
What was the point of telling Qi Shi?

38
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:12,150
What could she do over there?

39
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:13,950
I was also panicking at the time.

40
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:15,590
If I were half as composed as you,

41
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,630
would I come in last

42
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:17,520
on every exam?

43
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,380
W-Where are you going?

44
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:20,430
To find Qi Shi.

45
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:24,000
The last science exam is worth 300 points.

46
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,960
You completely ruined

47
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,290
Qi Shi's bright future!

48
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,270
Qi Shi!

49
00:04:37,190 --> 00:04:37,630
Qi Shi!

50
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,400
Calm down!

51
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:45,490
You can't catch up.

52
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:12,160
Your leg is doing well enough
for you to get out of bed now.

53
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,360
Let it heal properly,

54
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,560
and it should be fine.

55
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,040
But

56
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,600
the hairline fracture

57
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,310
has a risk of reinjury.

58
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,360
After a comprehensive evaluation,

59
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,020
we advise you to quit running.

60
00:05:27,830 --> 00:05:28,630
Qi Zhi,

61
00:05:29,350 --> 00:05:32,240
you can't represent
the provincial team to compete anymore.

62
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,040
But it's okay.

63
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:34,560
You can still be

64
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,020
a PE teacher in the future.

65
00:06:07,190 --> 00:06:07,920
Zhou Xuanyu!

66
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,480
Zhou Xuanyu, get the hell out here!

67
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:16,850
Zhou Xuanyu!

68
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,130
Don't hide in your house

69
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,160
like a coward!

70
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,360
Zhou Xuanyu!

71
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,860
I know you're home!

72
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,050
Get the hell out here, you bastard!

73
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:26,170
I'm right here.

74
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:26,800
Boss,

75
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:29,960
why do you keep hiding from that idiot?

76
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:30,750
What makes you think

77
00:06:30,750 --> 00:06:31,880
I'm hiding from him?

78
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:33,950
We were detained for days.

79
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:35,150
You want to go back in?

80
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,159
We need to be

81
00:06:36,159 --> 00:06:37,490
law-abiding citizens.

82
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:38,890
Understand?

83
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,409
Understood.

84
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,130
Boss, you

85
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,750
just don't want to waste your time

86
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:43,550
on that idiot.

87
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:45,390
Zhou Xuanyu!

88
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:03,680
Oh, no! There's a fire!

89
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:05,950
Boss.

90
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,030
Boss,

91
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,880
looks like smoke is coming
from your house.

92
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:13,110
Qi Zhi, you bastard!

93
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:14,640
Call the police now!

94
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:16,800
There's a fire!

95
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,390
Qi Zhi!

96
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,010
The Zhous' house is on fire!

97
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,070
You must have got the wrong person.

98
00:07:33,070 --> 00:07:34,070
With his seriously injured leg,

99
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,600
he couldn't be the one who set the fire.

100
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,950
You must have got the wrong person.

101
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:37,750
Yes, officer.

102
00:07:38,070 --> 00:07:38,870
There's no way

103
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:39,750
my son did this.

104
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:41,190
We'll figure out

105
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:41,950
whether he did it or not

106
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:43,000
when we get to the station.

107
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,630
Take him away.

108
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:44,480
Wait, Zhi.

109
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:45,750
Zhi, say something. Zhi...

110
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:47,000
Did you do it, Zhi?

111
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,600
Tell the police.

112
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:49,360
Zhi, speak up!

113
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,120
Say something!

114
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,430
Qi Zhi, say something.

115
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,130
Qi Zhi, you acted too impulsively!

116
00:07:56,130 --> 00:07:57,360
You ruined your own future

117
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,380
as well as our family.

118
00:07:58,380 --> 00:07:59,680
Do you know that, Qi Zhi?

119
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,280
Officers,

120
00:08:00,510 --> 00:08:02,040
I'm begging you on my knees.

121
00:08:02,070 --> 00:08:03,160
Don't take him away.

122
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:03,750
Mom!

123
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:04,630
Mom, don't do this.

124
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:05,510
Don't interfere with our duties.

125
00:08:05,510 --> 00:08:06,080
Mom...

126
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:07,870
Get up, come on.

127
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:08,650
Do not interfere with our work,

128
00:08:08,650 --> 00:08:09,160
please.

129
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,570
I'll go take a look.

130
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:14,210
Si, I'm going with you.

131
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,160
I'll

132
00:08:16,630 --> 00:08:17,750
also go ask around

133
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,500
and see what exactly happened.

134
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:20,800
Grab a bite before you go.

135
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:21,750
I'm not eating.

136
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,680
Qi Zhi

137
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,909
was destined to face this ordeal.

138
00:08:37,270 --> 00:08:37,669
Zhao,

139
00:08:38,150 --> 00:08:38,690
we need

140
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,720
to expedite this case.

141
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,240
Mom.

142
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:41,640
Mom.

143
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,070
Officer,

144
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,120
how is my son doing?

145
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,320
Can I see him?

146
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:47,840
Suspects aren't allowed

147
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:50,360
to see their families
in criminal detention.

148
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,270
Even prisoners are allowed family visits.

149
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,240
Why can't we see him?

150
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:53,720
Exactly.

151
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,450
Please let us see him just once.

152
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:56,510
We're his family.

153
00:08:56,510 --> 00:08:58,030
We need to know what's going on.

154
00:08:58,030 --> 00:08:59,170
Yes, officer,

155
00:08:59,190 --> 00:09:00,880
please just let us see him.

156
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:02,030
I know him well.

157
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:03,360
He wouldn't do such a thing.

158
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,870
You must investigate this thoroughly.

159
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:05,720
Officer,

160
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,300
will my brother really be sentenced?

161
00:09:08,710 --> 00:09:09,550
The case is currently

162
00:09:09,550 --> 00:09:10,810
under investigation.

163
00:09:11,030 --> 00:09:12,350
We'll contact you

164
00:09:12,550 --> 00:09:14,600
once we have confirmed information.

165
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,230
Please go home and wait for our update.

166
00:09:16,230 --> 00:09:16,620
Well...

167
00:09:16,620 --> 00:09:17,280
Mrs. Huo.

168
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,730
Don't worry.

169
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:21,150
The police will definitely figure it out.

170
00:09:21,150 --> 00:09:22,480
Qi Zhi will be fine for sure.

171
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,210
Don't worry.

172
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,600
-Dong Fang.
-Dad.

173
00:09:35,030 --> 00:09:36,630
Did you get any news?

174
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:39,000
Isn't Liu's child

175
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,470
a lawyer?

176
00:09:41,290 --> 00:09:42,630
I told her the details

177
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,870
about Qi Zhi's case.

178
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:45,150
She said

179
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:47,800
it's considered arson.

180
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,630
What... What now?

181
00:09:53,270 --> 00:09:54,270
It's all my fault.

182
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,640
Were it not for me,

183
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:56,930
Qi Zhi wouldn't...

184
00:09:57,410 --> 00:09:58,540
Don't overthink it.

185
00:09:58,580 --> 00:09:59,790
I've already told Qi Shi

186
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,910
to find a lawyer

187
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,600
and see if there's any way

188
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:03,590
to help Qi Zhi.

189
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:08,170
Lawyer Liu,

190
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,120
you must help my brother.

191
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,290
Here.

192
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:13,960
Under Article 114

193
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,870
of the Criminal Law,

194
00:10:14,870 --> 00:10:16,000
where an act of arson

195
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,720
has not caused serious consequences,

196
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,670
the sentencing range

197
00:10:18,670 --> 00:10:19,600
is 3

198
00:10:19,770 --> 00:10:21,180
to 10 years in prison.

199
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:23,000
This is exactly

200
00:10:23,030 --> 00:10:24,630
Qi Zhi's current situation.

201
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,120
There is a way.

202
00:10:29,830 --> 00:10:31,050
I can draft a letter

203
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,030
of forgiveness.

204
00:10:32,470 --> 00:10:34,000
If we can get the victim

205
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:35,630
to sign this letter,

206
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,600
showing they

207
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,000
forgive what

208
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:38,960
the suspect did,

209
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,870
then in judicial practice,

210
00:10:40,870 --> 00:10:41,790
the court can

211
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:42,630
consider it

212
00:10:42,630 --> 00:10:45,830
as a discretionary circumstance
for a lighter sentence.

213
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,200
Y-You mean,

214
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:50,670
he could get a lighter sentence?

215
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,450
Zhou the Stingy Fat Cat hates our guts.

216
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,480
How could he forgive him?

217
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,750
Here's the thing.

218
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:03,840
The lawyer suggested Zhi

219
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,240
write an apology letter.

220
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,750
This way, there's a better chance

221
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:09,150
of getting the Zhou family's forgiveness.

222
00:11:09,550 --> 00:11:10,210
However...

223
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,280
However, with Qi Zhi's temper,

224
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:14,530
getting him to write
an apology letter to the Zhous

225
00:11:14,530 --> 00:11:15,790
is next to impossible.

226
00:11:33,870 --> 00:11:34,520
Lawyer Liu.

227
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,790
How did it go, Lawyer Liu?

228
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:37,790
Did Qi Zhi write the apology letter?

229
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:40,390
I've handled plenty of cases,

230
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:41,200
but this is the first time

231
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,080
I've met someone as stubborn as Qi Zhi.

232
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:43,610
He said

233
00:11:43,910 --> 00:11:45,360
he'd rather spend
a few more years in prison

234
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,690
than apologize to Zhou.

235
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:48,240
Is he crazy?

236
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:49,000
How can he still be

237
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,460
so stubborn at this point?

238
00:11:51,550 --> 00:11:52,860
An apology letter is crucial to getting

239
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:54,910
the victim's letter of forgiveness.

240
00:11:54,910 --> 00:11:56,910
But Qi Zhi just wouldn't cooperate.

241
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,390
I'm afraid you, as his family members,

242
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,650
have to figure out a way

243
00:11:59,650 --> 00:12:00,570
to talk

244
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,660
the victim into it.

245
00:12:19,790 --> 00:12:20,540
Hey, Qi!

246
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,700
Why are you two still here?

247
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,600
I told you,

248
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:24,730
Mr. Zhou

249
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:25,730
is currently in a meeting

250
00:12:25,730 --> 00:12:26,870
and has no time to see you.

251
00:12:26,870 --> 00:12:28,530
How about you two go back first,

252
00:12:28,530 --> 00:12:29,150
and I'll call you

253
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:30,010
when he's free?

254
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,540
We're not leaving.

255
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:35,070
If he doesn't come today,
he'll have to come tomorrow.

256
00:12:35,070 --> 00:12:35,870
We'll just wait here

257
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:36,960
every day anyway.

258
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,840
He has to come to work sooner or later.

259
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,040
We'll just wait here.

260
00:12:41,510 --> 00:12:43,360
Why are you so stubborn?

261
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:07,690
Mr. Zhou, are you heading out?

262
00:13:11,270 --> 00:13:11,960
Mr. Zhou!

263
00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:15,200
Mr. Zhou!

264
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:16,550
Mr. Zhou!

265
00:13:19,430 --> 00:13:21,110
Mr. Zhou! Mr. Zhou!

266
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:22,960
Mr. Zhou!

267
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,000
Mr. Zhou!

268
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:31,420
Mr. Zhou...

269
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,260
Put some of this on.

270
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,290
Your dad said...

271
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,720
Your dad said winters in Beining

272
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:30,780
are freezing cold.

273
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:35,380
You have to wear the kind of...

274
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,660
down jackets

275
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,320
that cover you from head to ankles,

276
00:14:42,670 --> 00:14:43,150
right?

277
00:14:45,670 --> 00:14:47,120
He said he'd buy one for Zhi.

278
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,450
Buy that down jacket...

279
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,260
Look, the down jacket is here.

280
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:56,790
Where is Zhi?

281
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,120
Where is my son?

282
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:10,270
Qi Shi...

283
00:15:15,110 --> 00:15:16,910
I'm not having a nightmare, am I?

284
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:19,670
Mom.

285
00:15:21,550 --> 00:15:24,210
He was about to make it
into the provincial team.

286
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:26,000
How did our son...

287
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:29,770
and our family...

288
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,120
end up like this?

289
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,440
I told you long ago

290
00:15:44,390 --> 00:15:46,030
to keep them apart.

291
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:46,500
But...

292
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:49,080
But Qi Zhi just wouldn't listen.

293
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:53,480
And you all

294
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:54,710
also went against me,

295
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:56,780
didn't you?

296
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,930
Cao Si... She's really something.

297
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,750
This girl's impressive... Well...

298
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:05,950
She really ruined...

299
00:16:07,150 --> 00:16:09,170
ruined our whole family.

300
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,440
Mom, well...

301
00:16:13,750 --> 00:16:15,840
Cao Si is not the one to blame.

302
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:21,790
Who else could it be other than her?

303
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:26,600
Would your brother
have been screwed otherwise?

304
00:16:26,670 --> 00:16:27,670
Would you not even

305
00:16:27,950 --> 00:16:29,680
have made it into the exam room?

306
00:16:32,530 --> 00:16:33,690
I told the two of them

307
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,960
to break up...

308
00:16:36,230 --> 00:16:37,880
Cao Si was just capable

309
00:16:37,910 --> 00:16:39,710
of keeping your brother hooked.

310
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,960
Yes, your brother acted on impulse.

311
00:16:42,330 --> 00:16:44,000
He fought and set a fire.

312
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:44,360
He...

313
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,700
But who did he do it for?

314
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,240
For who?

315
00:16:54,870 --> 00:16:56,200
Mom, what are you doing?

316
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:58,650
Mom!

317
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,340
Mom, come back!

318
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,030
Cao Si!

319
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,560
You jinx! You...

320
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,880
My son ended up in this state

321
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:10,960
all because of you!

322
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:14,000
You're always flirting with one guy

323
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:14,829
and another!

324
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,270
If you want to be a fortune-hunter,

325
00:17:16,270 --> 00:17:17,480
then go ahead!

326
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:19,160
Why did you have to ruin my son?

327
00:17:20,030 --> 00:17:21,690
Why did you have to ruin Qi Zhi?

328
00:17:22,079 --> 00:17:23,940
Her words are too harsh, Grandpa.

329
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:25,960
I'm going to talk to Mrs. Huo.

330
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,510
Just let her curse.

331
00:17:28,970 --> 00:17:30,650
Dad, come on, go stop her.

332
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,280
The neighbors are watching.

333
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:33,510
Would my son have gone

334
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,110
to fight someone?

335
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:36,170
Just let her curse.

336
00:17:36,190 --> 00:17:37,400
Would he have set a fire

337
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:39,260
and burned someone's house down?

338
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:41,830
I still haven't even

339
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:43,790
been able to see him!

340
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:46,350
Si,

341
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:48,210
don't be sad.

342
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:48,970
Listen to me.

343
00:17:49,610 --> 00:17:50,160
Just let it go in one ear

344
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,160
and out the other.

345
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,030
Don't you know

346
00:17:53,050 --> 00:17:54,510
Mrs. Huo Qinglian's temper?

347
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:55,040
Yeah, Si,

348
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:56,170
don't be sad.

349
00:17:56,830 --> 00:17:59,030
Dad is already trying
to find a way, isn't he?

350
00:17:59,030 --> 00:17:59,920
I heard that as long as the Zhou family

351
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:01,110
signs the letter of forgiveness,

352
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,590
Qi Zhi might still have a chance.

353
00:18:02,590 --> 00:18:03,790
A world champion...

354
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:06,680
He was going to be a world champion!

355
00:18:07,110 --> 00:18:09,310
His leg is injured,

356
00:18:09,550 --> 00:18:11,550
and the provincial team
doesn't want him anymore.

357
00:18:11,550 --> 00:18:12,790
Cao Si...

358
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:15,830
Cao Si!

359
00:18:17,210 --> 00:18:18,080
You've ruined

360
00:18:18,110 --> 00:18:20,000
our family!

361
00:18:20,970 --> 00:18:23,040
No, Dad, go stop her!

362
00:18:23,070 --> 00:18:24,030
Her words are too harsh!

363
00:18:24,030 --> 00:18:25,590
People might be laughing at us.

364
00:18:25,590 --> 00:18:27,640
Hurry up! Come on!

365
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:28,830
Go now!

366
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,790
Go stop her!

367
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:37,680
Enough.

368
00:18:38,420 --> 00:18:39,680
You've scolded enough.

369
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,480
Let's go home.

370
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:42,680
Don't make a scene
in front of the neighbors.

371
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,000
I just want the neighbors to see

372
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:44,960
what the Cao family

373
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,440
did to us

374
00:18:46,550 --> 00:18:47,830
and how they bully our family,

375
00:18:47,830 --> 00:18:48,890
young and old.

376
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:49,720
Mom, come on.

377
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,400
Will your cursing

378
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,830
bring Zhi back?

379
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,720
Your brother is only 22!

380
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,550
22!

381
00:19:03,110 --> 00:19:06,070
His life is ruined.

382
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:10,160
Ruined...

383
00:19:10,850 --> 00:19:11,240
Aren't we

384
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:13,160
trying to figure out a way?

385
00:19:13,790 --> 00:19:14,830
Just scrape the money together

386
00:19:14,830 --> 00:19:16,230
and beg for forgiveness.

387
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:17,410
What else can we do?

388
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:20,400
Life goes on!

389
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:35,830
All right, stop looking.

390
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:37,160
There's nothing to see.

391
00:19:39,270 --> 00:19:40,070
Stop staring!

392
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:42,120
There's nothing to see!

393
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:24,970
Mr. Zhou.

394
00:20:25,510 --> 00:20:26,040
Mr. Zhou.

395
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:27,760
Cao Dongfang?

396
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:28,930
What?

397
00:20:29,830 --> 00:20:31,590
Are you here to plead for Qi Zhi, too?

398
00:20:31,590 --> 00:20:31,920
Yeah.

399
00:20:32,030 --> 00:20:33,090
Mr. Zhou, Mr. Zhou,

400
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:34,970
I watched this kid grow up.

401
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,070
He's been a sensible, good kid

402
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:37,070
since childhood.

403
00:20:37,350 --> 00:20:38,280
But this time...

404
00:20:38,510 --> 00:20:40,310
I don't know what happened this time.

405
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:41,240
Just a while ago,

406
00:20:41,270 --> 00:20:43,160
he won the championship
at the Provincial Games

407
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:44,800
and was selected by the provincial team.

408
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:45,960
If it weren't for this case,

409
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,330
he'd definitely be training

410
00:20:47,330 --> 00:20:48,920
with the provincial team now

411
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:49,720
and might even

412
00:20:49,830 --> 00:20:52,030
win glory for our country in the future.

413
00:20:53,270 --> 00:20:54,370
Mr. Zhou, look,

414
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,740
considering we are

415
00:20:55,750 --> 00:20:57,240
colleagues, could you please

416
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:58,200
cut him some slack

417
00:20:58,200 --> 00:20:59,800
and give him another chance?

418
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,260
Cut him some slack?

419
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:04,830
Do you think

420
00:21:04,830 --> 00:21:06,490
the law can cut him some slack?

421
00:21:06,550 --> 00:21:07,450
He set fire

422
00:21:07,490 --> 00:21:08,450
to my house.

423
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:09,960
That's a criminal offense!

424
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:11,350
If the fire hadn't been put out quickly,

425
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:12,670
it could have spread

426
00:21:12,740 --> 00:21:13,850
to the neighbors

427
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:14,830
and caused a disaster.

428
00:21:14,830 --> 00:21:15,110
I know.

429
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:16,200
It's a blatant disregard

430
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:17,070
for the law!

431
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:19,110
Whether he's a provincial champion

432
00:21:19,110 --> 00:21:20,310
or an Olympic champion,

433
00:21:20,310 --> 00:21:21,640
I'm sending him to jail!

434
00:21:22,270 --> 00:21:24,080
Yes, yes. But he's young, isn't he?

435
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:25,480
It's normal for young people

436
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,830
to make mistakes, right?

437
00:21:26,830 --> 00:21:28,290
Besides, we are all his...

438
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:29,880
Go away! Get out of here!

439
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:30,540
Mr. Zhou.

440
00:21:32,550 --> 00:21:32,920
Okay.

441
00:21:55,420 --> 00:21:56,310
It's so hot today.

442
00:21:56,310 --> 00:21:57,770
Why did you close the door?

443
00:21:59,240 --> 00:21:59,880
How's it?

444
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:02,720
Did the Zhou family agree to settle?

445
00:22:17,270 --> 00:22:17,790
Si,

446
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:19,570
don't overthink it.

447
00:22:20,070 --> 00:22:20,590
This has

448
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:22,520
absolutely nothing to do with you.

449
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:26,900
If it had nothing to do with me,

450
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:29,810
why would Mrs. Huo get so worked up?

451
00:22:30,900 --> 00:22:32,110
Why does Dad keep going

452
00:22:32,110 --> 00:22:33,440
to meet the Zhou family?

453
00:22:33,790 --> 00:22:34,920
If it weren't for me,

454
00:22:35,310 --> 00:22:37,160
Qi Zhi wouldn't have gotten kicked off
the provincial team

455
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:38,510
or ended up in jail.

456
00:23:06,110 --> 00:23:06,550
Qi Shi.

457
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,330
How is your brother?

458
00:23:25,480 --> 00:23:26,000
Si,

459
00:23:29,790 --> 00:23:31,070
you'd better not

460
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,920
come to our house for a while.

461
00:24:00,340 --> 00:24:01,210
Still awake?

462
00:24:16,560 --> 00:24:17,210
Qi Aihua,

463
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:19,570
how could you
still be in the mood to drink?

464
00:24:20,070 --> 00:24:22,830
I... I just drank this little bit.

465
00:24:23,750 --> 00:24:25,410
Our son is in such big trouble.

466
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:28,880
As a grown man,

467
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:31,530
what else can you do besides drinking?

468
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,620
You're such a coward.

469
00:24:34,920 --> 00:24:36,240
Are you even a man?

470
00:24:37,790 --> 00:24:38,400
Indeed.

471
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:41,620
I'm a loser.

472
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:46,600
I'm a good-for-nothing.
I'm not like a man.

473
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:58,090
Do you think I feel okay about this?

474
00:25:03,830 --> 00:25:04,960
I'm suffering, too.

475
00:25:10,310 --> 00:25:12,310
With our family in such a big crisis,

476
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:14,680
I'm a grown man,

477
00:25:15,110 --> 00:25:16,510
but I can't help at all.

478
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,360
I can't make much money. I...

479
00:25:21,360 --> 00:25:21,960
I...

480
00:25:22,350 --> 00:25:23,790
I can do nothing at all.

481
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:35,000
Qi Zhi is in such big trouble,

482
00:25:35,820 --> 00:25:38,020
and I can't even protect him if I want to.

483
00:25:41,830 --> 00:25:43,960
I am incompetent and good for nothing!

484
00:25:44,830 --> 00:25:46,720
I'm a loser... A loser...

485
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:55,720
It's all the Cao family's fault.

486
00:25:57,270 --> 00:25:58,160
None of them are

487
00:25:58,180 --> 00:25:59,290
any good.

488
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:04,480
Cao Dongfang used that little favor

489
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:05,740
he did for you back then

490
00:26:05,810 --> 00:26:07,140
to take our son with him.

491
00:26:11,590 --> 00:26:12,320
These years,

492
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:16,280
every time I saw our son

493
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:17,790
having a good time at his place,

494
00:26:17,790 --> 00:26:18,640
it just...

495
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,350
just killed me inside.

496
00:26:22,350 --> 00:26:23,440
It hurt so much.

497
00:26:24,750 --> 00:26:25,610
But look at him.

498
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:28,680
We raised Qi Shi

499
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:30,130
with so much effort

500
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:31,420
and suffered so much.

501
00:26:32,790 --> 00:26:34,320
Has he ever appreciated it?

502
00:26:35,560 --> 00:26:36,450
You saw him

503
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,940
as a good buddy and treated him so well,

504
00:26:37,940 --> 00:26:39,850
while he made a fool of you.

505
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:43,590
When your mine was restructured,

506
00:26:43,590 --> 00:26:44,960
he reported you

507
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:46,680
without hesitation.

508
00:26:47,310 --> 00:26:48,680
When he ruined your career,

509
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:50,400
did he care about your brotherhood

510
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,960
or our family's survival?

511
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:55,400
That's in the past. Let it slide.

512
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,640
Why bring it up again?

513
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:58,120
Let it slide? I can't.

514
00:26:58,440 --> 00:26:59,640
I just can't let it go.

515
00:27:01,540 --> 00:27:03,940
The most infuriating part
is about our son.

516
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:08,000
He was doing perfectly well,

517
00:27:08,070 --> 00:27:09,520
worked so hard,

518
00:27:09,550 --> 00:27:12,310
and finally got selected
for the provincial team.

519
00:27:12,310 --> 00:27:13,910
But he threw everything away

520
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:16,280
just for Cao Si.

521
00:27:16,310 --> 00:27:17,350
He gave up his future

522
00:27:17,350 --> 00:27:18,270
and his family.

523
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:19,170
Everything...

524
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:21,440
Everything is ruined.

525
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:28,550
Fine.

526
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:30,110
Since the Cao family

527
00:27:30,110 --> 00:27:31,570
won't let me live in peace,

528
00:27:32,470 --> 00:27:33,800
I won't let them either.

529
00:27:34,270 --> 00:27:36,170
I'm going to burn their house down, too.

530
00:27:36,170 --> 00:27:37,330
Let me vent my anger.

531
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,080
Qinglian,

532
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:40,870
don't be crazy.

533
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:42,160
If you burn their house down,

534
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:43,480
how are we supposed to carry on?

535
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:45,520
Let's just all end our peaceful lives!

536
00:27:45,520 --> 00:27:46,440
I'm going to tell everyone

537
00:27:46,440 --> 00:27:47,840
what happened back then!

538
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:48,640
You...

539
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:49,830
Move aside!

540
00:27:49,830 --> 00:27:50,890
What are you doing?

541
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:53,240
-Qinglian!
-Mom, your blood pressure medicine.

542
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,350
Qi Shi, you're back just in time.

543
00:27:54,350 --> 00:27:55,080
Come with me.

544
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:55,730
Where to?

545
00:27:55,830 --> 00:27:56,350
No, no...

546
00:27:56,350 --> 00:27:57,110
Go back to your room.

547
00:27:57,110 --> 00:27:57,960
Stay out of this.

548
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:58,370
Qi Aihua,

549
00:27:58,370 --> 00:27:59,250
get out of my way!

550
00:27:59,250 --> 00:27:59,960
What are you doing?

551
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:01,000
I'm going to tell them what happened

552
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:01,600
back then!

553
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:02,790
Mom! Mom!

554
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:04,480
Stop making a scene, okay?

555
00:28:05,110 --> 00:28:06,220
Will you ever stop?

556
00:28:41,550 --> 00:28:43,080
Honey, please don't leave.

557
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:44,920
I'm sorry.

558
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:47,480
I...

559
00:28:48,510 --> 00:28:49,590
I was drunk.

560
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:53,000
Hit me.

561
00:28:54,110 --> 00:28:55,480
Hit me however you want.

562
00:28:55,690 --> 00:28:56,560
Hit me

563
00:28:56,590 --> 00:28:58,480
as long as it makes you feel better.

564
00:28:58,480 --> 00:28:59,410
Get away from me.

565
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:08,760
I'm sorry.

566
00:29:11,110 --> 00:29:11,750
I promise

567
00:29:12,640 --> 00:29:13,900
it won't happen again.

568
00:29:16,070 --> 00:29:16,510
Look,

569
00:29:17,070 --> 00:29:18,480
my hand is still shaking.

570
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:28,750
Honey.

571
00:29:32,070 --> 00:29:33,510
Qi Zhi's in trouble,

572
00:29:35,010 --> 00:29:35,930
but we still

573
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:36,960
have to move on.

574
00:29:38,550 --> 00:29:39,680
We still have Qi Shi

575
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:41,120
and...

576
00:29:45,070 --> 00:29:46,070
And Cao Xin.

577
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:51,250
♪ Bright moonlight ♪

578
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:51,120
Only if we stay strong

579
00:29:51,290 --> 00:29:53,960
♪ Draws my gaze up to the night ♪

580
00:29:52,510 --> 00:29:53,680
can Qi Zhi be okay.

581
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:59,090
♪ Though it falls right beside me ♪

582
00:29:58,350 --> 00:30:00,150
No matter what the future holds,

583
00:30:00,160 --> 00:30:02,500
♪ It feels empty ♪

584
00:30:02,790 --> 00:30:03,880
as long as we don't give up,

585
00:30:03,270 --> 00:30:05,310
♪ Just like you ♪

586
00:30:04,790 --> 00:30:05,350
things will

587
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:06,590
get better one day.

588
00:30:05,790 --> 00:30:09,000
♪ Your hands are warm to hold ♪

589
00:30:09,360 --> 00:30:13,810
♪ But I often fail to see ♪

590
00:30:14,770 --> 00:30:17,680
♪ The look in your eyes ♪

591
00:30:17,820 --> 00:30:21,750
♪ Clearly I, in this dark ♪

592
00:30:21,940 --> 00:30:25,770
♪ Endless dark ♪

593
00:30:25,790 --> 00:30:31,180
♪ Have followed you all this way ♪

594
00:30:31,510 --> 00:30:37,890
♪ Maybe I asked for too much ♪

595
00:30:38,580 --> 00:30:41,740
♪ A path lit all the way ♪

596
00:30:41,940 --> 00:30:45,190
♪ Only through love and choice ♪

597
00:30:45,750 --> 00:30:52,470
♪ Do I see I've had it all ♪

598
00:30:46,480 --> 00:30:47,000
Si,

599
00:30:48,310 --> 00:30:49,920
did you come to me just for Qi Zhi?

600
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,250
How is he better than me?

601
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:52,790
He hit so hard.

602
00:30:52,610 --> 00:30:59,930
♪ When you look at me, look at me ♪

603
00:30:53,030 --> 00:30:54,110
I'm still in pain.

604
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:57,350
You struck first.

605
00:30:58,640 --> 00:31:00,480
You're really wronging me this time.

606
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,920
I just wanted to have someone scare him.

607
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:03,080
Who knew he'd get serious immediately

608
00:31:02,340 --> 00:31:09,220
♪ I don't really ask for much ♪

609
00:31:03,110 --> 00:31:04,510
and whack us with his bag?

610
00:31:05,070 --> 00:31:05,920
H-He got hurt

611
00:31:05,920 --> 00:31:07,480
because he lost his balance.

612
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:08,240
Why did he take it out on me

613
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:09,570
and set fire to my house?

614
00:31:09,590 --> 00:31:10,320
No matter what,

615
00:31:09,790 --> 00:31:12,840
♪ You and the moonlight ♪

616
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:12,400
this

617
00:31:12,950 --> 00:31:16,090
♪ Have already fulfilled my wish ♪

618
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:14,600
happened because of you.

619
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:23,390
♪ It's okay not to be perfect ♪

620
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:19,760
You've already ruined him once.

621
00:31:19,790 --> 00:31:21,590
You can't ruin him a second time.

622
00:31:23,810 --> 00:31:31,070
♪ When you look at me, look at me ♪

623
00:31:28,960 --> 00:31:29,590
Si,

624
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:31,530
it's really not my call.

625
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:32,150
Our house was

626
00:31:32,150 --> 00:31:33,720
just renovated two years ago.

627
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:35,050
My dad is still furious.

628
00:31:35,310 --> 00:31:35,890
He said

629
00:31:36,070 --> 00:31:37,720
the Qi family's case is non-negotiable.

630
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:38,680
They must pay the compensation,

631
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:39,790
and he must serve his time.

632
00:31:39,790 --> 00:31:42,190
Everything will follow legal procedures.

633
00:31:46,310 --> 00:31:47,660
Si, don't go.

634
00:31:48,500 --> 00:31:49,000
My house

635
00:31:49,030 --> 00:31:50,760
got burned down because of you.

636
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:58,200
I'll go beg my dad.

637
00:32:00,110 --> 00:32:01,310
Just don't ignore me.

638
00:32:10,720 --> 00:32:12,110
What's wrong with your back?

639
00:32:12,110 --> 00:32:13,170
I just sprained it.

640
00:32:14,270 --> 00:32:14,870
Is it here?

641
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:16,480
Relax, relax.

642
00:32:16,830 --> 00:32:17,960
Let me rub it for you.

643
00:32:18,070 --> 00:32:18,670
Be gentle.

644
00:32:21,270 --> 00:32:22,200
Is it any better?

645
00:32:24,740 --> 00:32:25,880
I'll buy you some pig trotters later

646
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:26,680
for recovery.

647
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:32,430
Dad,

648
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:35,350
since the Qi family has already

649
00:32:35,350 --> 00:32:36,750
agreed to compensate us,

650
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:38,240
let's just

651
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:39,920
not push them too hard,

652
00:32:39,920 --> 00:32:40,310
okay?

653
00:32:41,560 --> 00:32:42,900
Besides, Qi Zhi will be in jail

654
00:32:42,900 --> 00:32:43,750
for several years

655
00:32:43,750 --> 00:32:44,880
to learn his lesson.

656
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:46,370
As businessmen,

657
00:32:46,750 --> 00:32:48,210
we should be magnanimous.

658
00:32:48,270 --> 00:32:49,400
Let's just sign this letter

659
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:50,260
of forgiveness

660
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:51,460
and do them a favor.

661
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:52,960
What do you think, Dad?

662
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:54,620
Did Cao Si ask you to talk to me?

663
00:32:59,090 --> 00:32:59,790
Dad,

664
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:02,280
I already promised Si.

665
00:33:02,920 --> 00:33:03,510
You must

666
00:33:03,510 --> 00:33:05,240
sign this for me no matter what.

667
00:33:05,270 --> 00:33:06,870
Otherwise, Si won't talk to me again.

668
00:33:06,870 --> 00:33:08,000
I'm really into her.

669
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,160
It hurts, Dad!

670
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:11,200
It hurts!

671
00:33:11,510 --> 00:33:12,510
You little brat!

672
00:33:12,510 --> 00:33:13,160
Are you really

673
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:14,360
trying to piss me off?

674
00:33:16,960 --> 00:33:17,490
Mr. Zhou.

675
00:33:20,350 --> 00:33:20,920
Mr. Zhou!

676
00:33:24,070 --> 00:33:24,680
Mr. Zhou.

677
00:33:26,920 --> 00:33:27,750
Your family

678
00:33:27,750 --> 00:33:29,410
really haunts me like ghosts.

679
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:31,630
I'm here today

680
00:33:32,430 --> 00:33:33,920
to formally apologize to you

681
00:33:33,920 --> 00:33:35,250
on behalf of my brother.

682
00:33:37,790 --> 00:33:38,520
I hope you can

683
00:33:38,550 --> 00:33:40,350
sign the letter of forgiveness.

684
00:33:40,350 --> 00:33:42,270
This is about my brother's future.

685
00:33:42,270 --> 00:33:44,130
An apology alone can settle this?

686
00:33:44,320 --> 00:33:45,560
My house was burned

687
00:33:45,590 --> 00:33:47,250
to the ground by your brother.

688
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,400
You want my forgiveness?

689
00:33:50,110 --> 00:33:51,270
Even if your brother rots in jail,

690
00:33:51,270 --> 00:33:52,480
it won't be enough for me.

691
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:52,810
Wait.

692
00:33:53,070 --> 00:33:54,000
Whatever your losses are,

693
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:55,260
we'll compensate you.

694
00:33:55,550 --> 00:33:57,400
It's really about my brother's future.

695
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:58,530
I'm begging you to give him a chance

696
00:33:58,530 --> 00:34:00,120
to turn over a new leaf.

697
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:01,400
Give him a chance?

698
00:34:02,070 --> 00:34:03,160
He broke the law.

699
00:34:04,070 --> 00:34:05,000
Go ask the judge

700
00:34:05,310 --> 00:34:06,770
if he'll give him a chance.

701
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:10,239
Mr. Zhou.

702
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,489
You know exactly why

703
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:16,360
he set that fire.

704
00:34:16,690 --> 00:34:18,320
My brother's leg is seriously injured,

705
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:20,380
and his future is completely ruined.

706
00:34:20,590 --> 00:34:22,070
You want to hold someone accountable?

707
00:34:22,070 --> 00:34:24,230
Zhou Xuanyu provoked him first.

708
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:26,960
You can't say
it has nothing to do with him.

709
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:27,440
So?

710
00:34:28,550 --> 00:34:29,880
Are you threatening me?

711
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:36,590
I'm here to negotiate a settlement.

712
00:34:36,590 --> 00:34:37,920
As long as you sign this,

713
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:40,060
we can consider

714
00:34:40,590 --> 00:34:42,449
letting Zhou Xuanyu off the hook.

715
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:47,679
You're really something, little girl.

716
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:06,400
Get in.

717
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:08,010
I need to talk to you.

718
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:31,890
We didn't have time to cook.

719
00:35:33,190 --> 00:35:34,790
Let's just make do with this.

720
00:35:39,960 --> 00:35:40,690
Where's Mom?

721
00:35:41,920 --> 00:35:43,780
Your mom said she has no appetite.

722
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:45,820
She's lying in bed.

723
00:35:48,360 --> 00:35:50,420
She hasn't had anything for two days.

724
00:35:50,590 --> 00:35:51,960
How can her body take it?

725
00:35:59,230 --> 00:35:59,760
Sweetie,

726
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:01,800
your mom and I have been

727
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:03,600
busy with Zhi's case these days.

728
00:36:04,710 --> 00:36:06,770
We haven't had time to care about you.

729
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:09,670
You missed

730
00:36:09,670 --> 00:36:11,800
such an important exam because of Zhi.

731
00:36:13,440 --> 00:36:15,440
Are you very upset deep down inside?

732
00:36:17,230 --> 00:36:18,070
I'm fine, Dad.

733
00:36:19,130 --> 00:36:19,840
Just eat up.

734
00:36:26,190 --> 00:36:27,650
I have no appetite either.

735
00:36:28,630 --> 00:36:29,890
Take your time eating.

736
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:02,400
Are you...

737
00:37:03,030 --> 00:37:03,560
alright?

738
00:37:07,110 --> 00:37:09,240
Worst case, I'll just repeat the year.

739
00:37:13,840 --> 00:37:15,500
What about Mr. Qi and Mrs. Huo?

740
00:37:17,670 --> 00:37:19,130
How could they be alright?

741
00:37:33,230 --> 00:37:34,090
You made these?

742
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:36,060
I spent all afternoon on them.

743
00:37:39,070 --> 00:37:40,150
I saw Mrs. Huo making buns

744
00:37:40,150 --> 00:37:41,010
pretty easily.

745
00:37:41,680 --> 00:37:42,800
But when I tried it myself,

746
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,660
it was a totally different story.

747
00:37:45,370 --> 00:37:46,190
It's my first time.

748
00:37:46,190 --> 00:37:47,790
T-This is the best I could do.

749
00:37:52,480 --> 00:37:53,280
I just feel that

750
00:37:53,280 --> 00:37:54,230
Mr. Qi and Mrs. Huo

751
00:37:54,230 --> 00:37:55,490
have been so good to me.

752
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:59,660
With our families in this situation now,

753
00:38:00,980 --> 00:38:02,710
I want to do something for them.

754
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:34,230
Mom,

755
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:36,980
please grab a bite.

756
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:38,800
Cao Xin made these buns.

757
00:38:45,880 --> 00:38:47,510
Cao Xin made them?

758
00:38:47,840 --> 00:38:49,760
The filling is a bit salty.

759
00:38:50,230 --> 00:38:52,360
And the dough was even unleavened.

760
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:55,400
Cao Xin has grown up.

761
00:38:55,710 --> 00:38:57,110
He can even make buns now.

762
00:39:04,190 --> 00:39:05,190
It's quite salty.

763
00:39:05,230 --> 00:39:06,960
Mom, I'll go get you some water.

764
00:39:12,260 --> 00:39:13,590
Your mom is just hungry.

765
00:39:18,550 --> 00:39:19,950
Cao Xin has grown up.

766
00:39:21,800 --> 00:39:23,000
But what about Qi Zhi?

767
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:27,320
His good life was ruined.

768
00:39:31,800 --> 00:39:32,990
And Qi Shi,

769
00:39:34,880 --> 00:39:36,150
you could have

770
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:39,510
gotten into a top university.

771
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:43,010
But because of Zhi's case,

772
00:39:44,070 --> 00:39:45,630
you missed one exam.

773
00:39:50,590 --> 00:39:52,800
What did our family do to deserve this?

774
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:17,400
The victim

775
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:19,280
gave me the letter of forgiveness.

776
00:40:19,280 --> 00:40:20,190
With this letter,

777
00:40:20,190 --> 00:40:21,790
the rest will be much easier.

778
00:40:32,670 --> 00:40:33,330
Lawyer Liu,

779
00:40:33,960 --> 00:40:34,510
you saved

780
00:40:34,510 --> 00:40:35,760
our family.

781
00:40:37,550 --> 00:40:38,810
The victim's cooperation is

782
00:40:38,810 --> 00:40:39,710
thanks to your efforts

783
00:40:39,710 --> 00:40:41,510
in persuading them, definitely.

784
00:40:41,510 --> 00:40:42,710
I'm just doing my job.

785
00:40:44,030 --> 00:40:45,510
I'll be meeting Qi Zhi in a bit.

786
00:40:45,510 --> 00:40:47,310
Do you have any messages for him?

787
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,410
What is there to say?

788
00:41:01,480 --> 00:41:02,920
Just tell him

789
00:41:03,630 --> 00:41:04,760
to fully cooperate.

790
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:08,900
Since things have come to this point,

791
00:41:09,680 --> 00:41:11,140
just don't think too much.

792
00:41:13,260 --> 00:41:14,450
Ask him to eat well

793
00:41:14,480 --> 00:41:15,230
and recover

794
00:41:16,710 --> 00:41:18,240
from his injuries in there.

795
00:41:21,190 --> 00:41:21,960
It's no big deal

796
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:23,110
if he can't be an athlete,

797
00:41:23,110 --> 00:41:23,510
right?

798
00:41:24,230 --> 00:41:25,440
We, as his parents, don't expect him

799
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,440
to be successful.

800
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:31,740
We j-just want to have him back home soon.

801
00:41:34,840 --> 00:41:35,250
Thank you.

802
00:41:35,250 --> 00:41:36,850
-Thank you.
-One more thing.

803
00:41:36,870 --> 00:41:37,830
Tell him

804
00:41:38,030 --> 00:41:40,230
not to get into any more fights in there.

805
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:42,600
That place has a motley crew.

806
00:41:42,880 --> 00:41:44,540
Tell him to learn from his dad.

807
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:46,840
A real man knows

808
00:41:46,840 --> 00:41:48,840
when to yield and when to stand tall.

809
00:41:49,480 --> 00:41:50,680
Keep cool in trouble.

810
00:41:52,150 --> 00:41:53,880
Walk away if he can't keep cool.

811
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:56,860
I'll pass all your words on to him.

812
00:41:59,110 --> 00:42:00,640
Please tell my brother that

813
00:42:01,880 --> 00:42:03,880
he still owes me a box of chocolates.

814
00:42:04,550 --> 00:42:05,070
Got it.

815
00:42:07,920 --> 00:42:08,590
Thank you.

816
00:42:56,590 --> 00:42:57,920
You should have seen it.

817
00:42:58,180 --> 00:42:59,750
She's like a completely different person

818
00:42:59,750 --> 00:43:01,230
from head to toe.

819
00:43:02,030 --> 00:43:03,070
I stared at her for a few minutes

820
00:43:03,070 --> 00:43:04,320
and still couldn't believe it was her.
